config TOTEM_ACTIVE_PROFILE_ONLY
	bool "Only accept BLE connections from the active profile's device"
	depends on ZMK_BLE
	default n
	help
	  When enabled, the central half immediately disconnects any host that
	  connects but is not the currently-selected BLE profile's bonded device.
	  This stops other previously-paired computers (saved on inactive profiles)
	  from grabbing the keyboard in the background, which caused connect/drop
	  churn, battery drain, and cross-wake. No device addresses are configured;
	  the active profile is read at runtime. Central (left) half only.
